# Create View Rule

Follow this rule when creating a new feature view.

## Directory Structure

```
lib/src/features/[feature_name]/
├── presentation/
│   ├── [feature_name]_screen.dart
│   ├── [feature_name]_cubit.dart
│   └── [feature_name]_state.dart
├── domain/
│   └── entities/          # (optional)
└── data/                  # (optional)
```

## Step 1: State

```dart
import 'package:equatable/equatable.dart';

enum MyFeatureStatus { initial, loading, success, error }

class MyFeatureState extends Equatable {
  final MyFeatureStatus status;
  final String? errorMessage;

  const MyFeatureState({
    this.status = MyFeatureStatus.initial,
    this.errorMessage,
  });

  MyFeatureState copyWith({...}) => MyFeatureState(...);

  @override
  List<Object?> get props => [status, errorMessage];
}
```

## Step 2: Cubit

```dart
import 'package:cursor_edu_core/cursor_edu_core.dart';

class MyFeatureCubit extends BaseViewModelCubit<MyFeatureState> {
  MyFeatureCubit() : super(const MyFeatureState());

  Future<void> loadData() async {
    stateChanger(state.copyWith(status: MyFeatureStatus.loading));
    try {
      stateChanger(state.copyWith(status: MyFeatureStatus.success));
    } catch (e) {
      stateChanger(state.copyWith(
        status: MyFeatureStatus.error,
        errorMessage: e.toString(),
      ));
    }
  }
}
```

## Step 3: View

```dart
import 'package:flutter/material.dart';
import 'package:cursor_edu_core/cursor_edu_core.dart';

class MyFeatureScreen extends MasterView<MyFeatureCubit, MyFeatureState> {
  MyFeatureScreen({super.key}) : super(cubit: MyFeatureCubit());

  @override
  void initialContent(MyFeatureCubit cubit, BuildContext context) {
    cubit.loadData();
  }

  @override
  Widget viewContent(BuildContext context, MyFeatureCubit cubit, MyFeatureState state) {
    if (state.status == MyFeatureStatus.loading) return const LoadingView();
    if (state.status == MyFeatureStatus.error) return ErrorView(message: state.errorMessage);
    return _buildContent(state);
  }
}
```

## Checklist

- [ ] State extends Equatable, copyWith(), props
- [ ] Cubit extends BaseViewModelCubit, uses stateChanger()
- [ ] View extends MasterView, initialContent + viewContent
